      "writtenOn": "2025-08-06T09:50:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should land something like this. We can have the toggle available and then finch trial it for Chrome.  \n\nThis change gives us the gains of concurrent compute dispatch without significant risk as it is narrowly targeted.",
